{"id":706,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Able to freely control the hardness of its metallic shell. It loathes solitude and is extremely clingy—it will fume and run riot if those dearest to it ever leave its side."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Its form of offense is forcefully stretching out its horns. The strikes land 100 times harder than any blow from a heavyweight boxer."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Sometimes it misunderstands instructions and appears dazed or bewildered. Many Trainers don’t mind, finding this behavior to be adorable."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Underneath its slimy skin is a thick layer of fat, and the combination of the two makes enemies’ attacks slide right off."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It’s very friendly toward people. If you grow close to it, Goodra will hug you with its sticky, slime-covered body. Don’t get mad."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It gets picked on because it’s meek. But then, whoever teased it gets to feel the full force of its horns and a good swatting from its thick tail."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"An amazingly friendly Pokémon, but if left to itself, loneliness overcomes it, and it oozes gooey tears."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"It attacks with retractable horns. It throws a punch that’s the equivalent of the force of a hundred pro boxers."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"This very friendly Dragon-type Pokémon will hug its beloved Trainer, leaving that Trainer covered in sticky slime."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Sap Sipper","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon takes no damage when hit by Grass-type moves. Instead, its Attack stat is boosted."},{"name":"Hydration","hidden":false,"description":"Cures the Pokémon's status conditions in rain."},{"name":"Gooey","hidden":true,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon lowers the attacker's Speed stat."}],"eggGroups":["Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Purple","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":704,"name":"Goomy","condition":null,"children":[{"id":705,"name":"Sliggoo","condition":"Lv. 40 or Lv. 40, in Hisui","children":[{"id":706,"name":"Goodra","condition":"Lv. 50, while raining","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,401],[1,33],[1,55],[1,71],[1,225],[1,342],[1,364],[1,491],[1,715],[15,182],[20,175],[25,352],[30,240],[43,174],[49,34],[58,330],[67,438]],"machine":[491,59,776,34,784,523,204,886,174,434,913,337,406,525,89,203,263,126,7,53,411,264,416,56,63,58,282,341,330,200,342,182,240,156,157,503,806,214,188,482,707,164,241,57,36,851,87,9,85,92,352,311],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me4-68","name":"Goodra","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Rare","number":"68","artist":"Tonji Matsuno","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-68/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-68/large"},{"id":"swsh12pt5gg-GG21","name":"Hisuian Goodra","set":"Crown Zenith Galarian Gallery","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Trainer Gallery Rare Holo","number":"GG21","artist":"You Iribi","img":"swsh12pt5gg/GG21"},{"id":"swsh11-134","name":"Hisuian Goodra","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"134","artist":"Akira Komayama","img":"swsh11/134"},{"id":"swsh11-135","name":"Hisuian Goodra V","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare Holo V","number":"135","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"swsh11/135"},{"id":"swsh11-136","name":"Hisuian Goodra VSTAR","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare Holo VSTAR","number":"136","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"swsh11/136"},{"id":"swsh11-187","name":"Hisuian Goodra V","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare Ultra","number":"187","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"swsh11/187"},{"id":"swsh11-202","name":"Hisuian Goodra VSTAR","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare Rainbow","number":"202","artist":"5ban Graphics","img":"swsh11/202"},{"id":"swsh8-197","name":"Goodra","set":"Fu